        <mxCell id="legend" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;Big idea&lt;/b&gt;&#xa;The hub is a memory + a bunch of HTTP routes.&#xa;Everything else (browser, ESP32s) just sends and receives JSON." vertex="1">
